silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_02_sections_03_concrete_anchor_2#validityinterval5 silm:hasLongDescription "The ValidityInterval5 is 2026-04-26 to 2026-10-26 (six months). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'ValidityInterval5', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
